<import src="../../templates/status.wxml"/><view class="page"><view class="eyebrow">FITCREW · TODAY</view><view class="title">今天，照顾好自己</view><view class="subtitle">从一个小行动开始，慢慢认识身体。</view><template is="status" data="{{loading,error,busy}}"/><block wx:if="{{state}}"><view class="card"><view class="h2">此刻的感受</view><view wx:if="{{logs.length}}" class="body">最近记录：{{logs[0].feeling}} · 精力 {{logs[0].energy}} / 5</view><view wx:else class="muted">还没有身体记录。你的第一条感受，会成为起点。</view><button bindtap="openLog">记录 Body Check</button></view><view class="card hero" wx:if="{{state.mission}}"><view class="pill">今天的一小步</view><view class="h2">{{state.mission.title}}</view><view class="body">{{state.mission.why}}</view><block wx:if="{{state.mission.status !== 'done' &amp;&amp; state.mission.status !== 'skipped'}}"><button class="primary" bindtap="mission" data-action="done" disabled="{{busy}}">我做到了</button><view class="row"><button bindtap="mission" data-action="lighten" disabled="{{busy}}">轻一点</button><button bindtap="mission" data-action="skip" disabled="{{busy}}">今天跳过</button></view></block><view wx:else class="pill">{{state.mission.status === 'done' ? '今日已完成' : '今天先休息'}}</view></view><view wx:else class="card hero"><view class="h2">选一个你在意的方向</view><view class="body">先设定旅程，再获得今天的行动。</view><button class="primary" bindtap="openJourney">开始我的旅程</button></view><view class="card"><view class="h2">观察与下一次记录</view><view class="muted">实验详情展示观察期限。按自己的节奏回来记录，不发送微信提醒。</view><button bindtap="openExperiments">查看实验</button></view></block><view class="footer">生活方式记录与观察，不提供疾病诊断或治疗建议。</view></view>
